    "created_at": "2025-05-07T09:30:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-07T09:30:32Z",
    "body": "Are you expecting to change show popover steps or just the hide popover steps? I am of the opinion that the implicit anchor should be set _before_ `beforetoggle` when showing, but also cleared _after_ `beforetoggle` when hiding. This is the current behaviour, so AIUI the change could be moving \"hide a popovers\" step 9 (`Set element's popover invoker to null.`) to be in 10.5 (before `Set element's implicit anchor element to null.`). Does this satisfy the criteria to close this issue?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/2857854731/reactions",
