    "updated_at": "2025-05-13T16:13:50Z",
    "body": "I'm struggling to come up with something observable to test this change against. Basically, the only effect of https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/11304 is that the `invoker` is now set after, rather than before, `beforetoggle`, for a closing transition. All that `invoker` affects is the focus navigation code. And `beforetoggle` isn't cancelable, so the popover gets closed either way. I tried things like setting it back to `display:block` and changing its `id`, but I can't get anything observable in the focus order. Suggestions appreciated! Otherwise, this will be a spec only change, practically.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
