    "body": "I'm not sure I fully understand the issue here, but if \n\n> I tried things like setting it back to `display:block` and changing its `id`, but I can't get anything observable in the focus order.\n\nis about how to make things focusable, usually setting `tabindex=\"0\"` on them does the trick.\n\n---\n\nAlso, is this testable even manually? That would give us some clues.\n\nIf not, then I guess this is really just an editorial spec refactoring?",
